      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">一、单项选择题：本题共7小题，每小题4分，共28分。在每小题给出的四个选项中，只有一项是最符合题目要求的。</section><br>5. 如图所示、金属薄板<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/1395892f87b1621f7976.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/2eb6402dffff6eb71ee5.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/0280c43f733e0a01fc36.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/f532bd0ba25b4341bba7.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">完全相同，用长导线和开关<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/117ce189917805bf0352.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/1d325e096410c77313ac.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">连接、与、与平行且间距相等，，均断开。、带等量异种电荷，c、不带电。一质量为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/d4937f6fde8719f9bb94.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、带电量为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/0fe8822c139c5cd61165.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">的微粒，静止在、之间、忽略边缘效应。则（     ）<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/13c6788e79c1f79e65df.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">",
