      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">一、单项选择题：本题共7小题，每小题4分，共28分。在每小题给出的四个选项中，只有一项是最符合题目要求的。</section><br>6. 如图所示，边长为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/6b1e0a21b93243b53333.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">的绝缘菱形支架EFGH竖直放置，FG边固定于水平地面，<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/1646ec24cad9e980315b.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。E、G两点各固定一带电小球，两小球带等量异种电荷。点H、F间固定一光滑绝缘直轨道，另一带电小球<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/0fe8822c139c5cd61165.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">从H点沿轨道由静止下滑至F点。重力加速度大小为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/b5c0d3eb96294cbab86b.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、小球均可视为点电荷。则小球在运动过程中（     ）<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/a663efffc71b823c9a83.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "content_html": "某时刻所受支持力可能为零"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "content_html": "到达F点时的速率为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/e8bcd8f3b4ba20c43b0d.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "content_html": "电势能先增大后减小"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "content_html": "所受电场力的冲量为零"
        }
