      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">一、单项选择题：本题共7小题，每小题4分，共28分。在每小题给出的四个选项中，只有一项是最符合题目要求的。</section><br>7. 如图所示，以恒定速率运行的传送带上有甲、乙两物块，二者与传送带相对静止，由不可伸长轻绳连接，之间无间隙。甲、乙质量均为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/d4937f6fde8719f9bb94.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，与传送带间的动摩擦因数分别<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/d9d0eb3e54b2f28b7d58.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/4c0988e5f8ff1cbf2b6f.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。某时刻、对乙施加水平向右的外力使其以恒定加速度<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/5e8806ae2f661ab0ecfd.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">（<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/b5c0d3eb96294cbab86b.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">为重力加速度大小）运动，经时间<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/9f64bc0c2af48c6dd674.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">撤去外力、再经时间<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/8ae128ae46df90737684.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">绳绷直。甲、乙均可视为质点、传送带足够长。则（     ）<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/2c9988e267ea6ff8cdce.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "content_html": "<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/9f64bc0c2af48c6dd674.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">和<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/8ae128ae46df90737684.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">满足<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/3bdd2a772a0bb8db8c8e.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "content_html": "从撤去外力到绳绷直，因摩擦产生的热量为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/4d412c78b42451a657a7.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "content_html": "绳绷直后瞬间甲的动能为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/07ebd86a446b929dcd49.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "content_html": "绳绷直以后甲、乙不会发生碰撞"
