      "type": "constructed_response",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">三、非选择题：本大题共5小题，共54分。考生根据要求作答。</section><br>13. 图（a）所示的空气垫是由多个相连的独立气室构成的包装材料，其简化模型如图（b）。充气前气室内均没有气体，在室温<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/899d8f5ddfe7eee892ce.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">下，将压强<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/55786c559eafdd7c49c6.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、体积<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/0dca07786ee9ea732d31.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">的气体通过单向阀充入10个气室（忽略气道内气体），此时每个气室均为圆柱体，横截面半径为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/d22517e369d187a9bb36.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> ，长度为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/cc2732167baa20d63792.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> ，当充气后的气室受到挤压变形时，其横截面变成图（c）所示的“跑道”形（两端是直径为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/39bc45bca8cf16bc509f.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> 的半圆），且气室长度、横截面周长均保持不变，气室内气体可视为理想气体，充气及挤压变形过程中气体温度始终与室温相同。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/e20e855739c03b1a654c.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（1）求充气后未挤压变形时气室中的压强<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/e33dee6633bb0504b32e.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">；<br>（2）求挤压变形后气室中的压强<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/eebb12422d2fcb8027f5.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">；<br>（3）已知气室中的压强超过<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/44a7ee4fcd83afc5cec7.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">时气室会爆破，若气室经如图（c）所示的挤压变形后，体积不变、室温升高，求气室不爆破的最高室温<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/689fbdb7325ef1b60dec.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。",
