      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">三、非选择题：本题共6小题，共60分。</section><br>14. 某实验小组用光传感器做双缝干涉实验并测量光的波长<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/7900447f16e2ce7e61cb.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/8d261aca9bb2847619f5.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（1）如图甲所示，将激光光源、间距<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/d6720a31b07c1cc3522e.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">的双缝和光传感器依次安装在光具座上，打开光源，调整光路，此过程中应避免激光直接射入眼睛，因为激光具有__________（填“亮度高”或“相干性好”）的特点。<br>（2）调整光路后，各器件位置如图甲所示，双缝到光传感器的距离<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/5d432aed22317d688a08.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">______cm。<br>（3）连接光传感器至计算机，得到干涉条纹的光强分布如图乙所示。测得A 区域的宽度为2.40 mm，则条纹间距<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/17513920f282717a0ee5.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">_______mm（保留两位有效数字）。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/fb12188ec32123d66541.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（4）利用公式<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/4a858c25c228d017f432.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">_______________（用<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/404aae09b0da6f761e50.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/fe1ebd5c59dafe5dc49c.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">和<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/a6dd93042a218b75ca58.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">表示），某同学计算得该激光的波长<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/7900447f16e2ce7e61cb.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/647be7db4574d284c3b3.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，此波长的光为电磁波中的__________（填“红外线”“可见光”或“紫外线”）。",
